cription:**\n\nWhen you open a link in a new tab ( target=\"_blank\" ), the page that opens in a new tab can access the initial tab and change it's location using the window.opener property.\n\n**Browsers Verified In:**\n\n  * Mozilla Firefox\n\n**Steps To Reproduce:**\n\n1. Visit https://www.coinbase.com/\n2. In Image F133659, If you notice the links go through `https://www.coinbase.com/external_redirect` except \"Bloomberg\"\n\n3. Since Bloomberg works on `http`, If you're in the same network you can manipulate the bloomberg page and inject a script which manipulates `window.opener`\n\n`window.opener.location.replace(\"https://www.notcoinbase.com\");`\n\nI understand this is very trivial to exploit and does not have very big impact","bounty_amount":"100.0","formatted_bounty":"$100","original_report_id":null,"original_report_url":null,"attachments":[{"id":133659,"file_name":"Screen_Shot_2016-11-09_at_8.56.52_PM.png","expiring_url":"https://hackerone-us-west-2-production-attachments.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/000/133/659/09f38b44a2562f33dd365df9d8aa844d53a1ec81/Screen_Shot_2016-11-09_at_8.56.52_PM.png?response-content-disposition=attachment%3B%20filename%3D%22Screen_Shot_2016-11-09_at_8.56.52_PM.png%22%3B%20filename%2A%3DUTF-8%27%27Screen_Shot_2016-11-09_at_8.56.52_PM.png\u0026response-content-type=image%2Fpng\u0026X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256\u0026X-Amz-Credential=[REDACTED_AWS_KEY]%2F20261028%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request\u0026X-Amz-Date=20261028T181437Z\u0026X-Amz-Expires=3600\u0026X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjED4aCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJIMEYCIQD4dAobTv8uI0vDbCGpu1XhTdg03pIJssJlORmnPNi7QgIhAOL2PQokhLaddLp%2BjCiULkmpYV31cfG9WAk9mRNXzGcfKrEFCAYQAxoMMDEzNjE5Mjc0ODQ5IgwqzK5Eiiytcj9ACBAqjgWE5SJkLYaIHCuiGDbq5twdL5sZ0ziNBXJTgiPsKah8VuQ7N8n7HYKEYVQfLXzwswO4lcG20lvv%2Br3oPviuKqy11RtQK2s0SyqEw4PK7rKJIBslVbDCgJebZQxAIz5f8xql7J%2Bg%2BKbE5HeQ8xpX5pqktAGrFSQEPEa%2BqFVb2F%2F88xaOpZLPoURaHdYta8%2FjGT7to2p9%2B6wFXIb8USz9o94c7v1WF%2BvO3GWy7R2dfZaq9sqWQTMuCzKGh%2Fwt1EnEZPHfZXe